      "sequence_position": 3,
      "problem": "If $z$ varies directly with $w$ and $z=72$ when $w=9$, find the relationship between $w$ and $z.$",
      "worked_solution": "Since $z$ varies directly with $w,$ we use the equation\n\n$$\nz=kw.\n$$\n\nNext, we use the fact that $z=72$ when $w=9$ to find $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}72 & =9\\cdot k \\\\ \\frac{72}{9} & =k \\\\ 8 & =k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our direct variation equation is\n\n$$\nz=8w.\n$$",
